<title>RUSSIA: LUKoil Jan-Sept pre-tax profit rises.</title>
<headline>LUKoil Jan-Sept pre-tax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months ended Sept 30</p>
<p>						1996	     1995</p>
<p>Income statement (roubles)</p>
<p>    Net sales (billion roubles)   32,557	   13,748</p>
<p>    Cost of sales		    -25,357	   -9,442</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   3,731	    1,951</p>
<p>    POFA				   3,080	    1,907</p>
<p>    Income before tax		  3,141	    1,927</p>
<p>    Net profit			   2,609	    1,197</p>
<p>    Retained profit			596		-52</p>
<p>    Net income per shares (rbls)   4,017	    1,843</p>
<p>Balance sheet items (roubles)</p>
<p>    Accounts receivable	     17,972	    6,810</p>
<p>    Accounts payable		  15,852	    8,186</p>
<p>    Long-term loans and credits	870		327</p>
<p>    Shareholders' equity	    50,090	   32,369</p>
<p>    Working capital		    5,026		773</p>
<p>Ratios</p>
<p>    Current assets/liabilities (pct) 130.0	    108.4</p>
<p>    net income/net revenues		8.0		8.7</p>
<p>    net income/assets			3.9		2.9</p>
<p>    net income/shareholders' equity    5.2		3.7</p>
<p>Production (tonnes)</p>
<p>    Crude oil output (million tonnes) 43.63	    42.93</p>
<p>    Oil products output		   13.69	    13.67</p>
<p>    Crude oil exports		     16.66	    13.96</p>
<p>     including free market		12.67	    13.83</p>
<p>    Oil products exports		   3.06	     1.79</p>
<p>    Oil gas output (bln cu meters)     1.79	     1.95</p>
<p>    Natural gas output		     0.35	     0.32</p>
<p>Income statement (dollars)</p>
<p>    Net sales (million dollars)    6,511	    3,018</p>
<p>    Cost of sales		     -5,071	   -2,073</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     746		428</p>
<p>    POFA				     616		419</p>
<p>    Income before tax		    628		423</p>
<p>    Net profit			     522		263</p>
<p>    Retained profit			119		-11</p>
<p>    Net income per shares (dollars)    0.80	     0.40</p>
<p>Balance sheet items (dollars)</p>
<p>    Accounts receivable		3,327	    1,511</p>
<p>    Accounts payable		   2,934	    1,816</p>
<p>    Long-term loans and credits	161		 73</p>
<p>Shareholders' equity 9,272 7,181</p>
<p>    Working capital			930		172</p>
<p>Production (barrels per day)</p>
<p>    Crude oil output (million bpd)     1.18	     1.16</p>
<p>NOTES - Full name OAO Neftyanaya Kompaniya LUKoil.</p>
<p>Consolidated figures to Russian accounting standards, accruals basis. Not audited. Revenues and profit calculated on accruals basis from 1996, boosting revenues and increase in revenues by 20-25 percent.</p>
<p>Balance sheet items as of September 30. POFA is profit from operating and financial activities.</p>
<p>Dollar conversion not official, based on following rates.</p>
<p>					  Jan-Sept 1996     Jan-Sept 1995</p>
<p>    End of period			5,402		 4,508</p>
<p>    Average				5,000		 4,554</p>
<p>Share ownership (ordinary shares/preferred shares) -- individuals own 2.3/23.4 percent, Russian companies 24.8/8.7 percent, foreign companies 2.5/26.7 percent, Russian nominees 10.9/30.0 percent, foreign nominees 23.1/11.2 percent, Russian government 36.4/0 percent.</p>
<p>Biggest shareholders are Russian government with 36.4 percent of ordinary shares, Bank of New York (as nominee) with 20.5 percent of ordinaries and 2.0 percent of preferred, NIKoil, with 17.7 percent of ordinaries and LUKoil-Rezerv-Invest (as nominee) with 7.8 percent of ordinaries and 1.3 percent of preferred.</p>
<p>--Jonathan Lynn, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
